# 行尾交给 git 管：Windows 上的批处理必须是 CRLF，否则 cmd.exe 会解析错
# （典型症状：双击 start_run_locally.cmd 一闪就关）。其余文本一律 LF。
* text=auto eol=lf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
*.txt text eol=crlf

# 二进制，别做任何转换
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.woff2 binary
*.woff binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.zip binary
